      "body": "<!-- markdownlint-disable -->\n\n## Overview\n\nFilter int4 WNA16 tuning configurations when the CUDA backend is selected. Related to #52845; awaiting consolidation with substantially overlapping #53005.\n\n## Claims\n\n- The existing patch filters CUDA BLOCK_SIZE_M/BLOCK_SIZE_K constraints while preserving the Triton search space.\n- No new code commit was made in the 2026-10-15 audit because #53005 addresses the same dispatch/filtering defect and reports hardware validation.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Re-read #52845 and compared both proposals with current main `c5f8adc0`.\n- #53005 contains the other author's RTX 5080 tuning result; it is external evidence, not a result run here.\n- No fresh test, tuning/model evaluation, main-sync commit or push is claimed for this unchanged PR head.\n\n## Details\n\nThe overlap is the CUDA-only search-space filter, not unrelated platform-specific tuning/config PRs. Per AGENTS.md's duplicate-work rule, further competing implementation work is deferred pending maintainer guidance. The existing regression tests can be consolidated into the chosen implementation if useful. Open since 2026-08-19.\n\nAI assistance was used for this audit and the original contribution. Human review and current-head GPU tuning validation remain required.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n\n- [ ] **Design Fit:** Minimizes impact on core components, reuses existing functionality, and justifies added complexity.\n- [ ] **Testing and Validation:** Validates the change and ensures any added tests are meaningful and reliable, with CI coverage or documented CI resource constraints and validation performed outside CI.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** Keeps code and comments clear and concise, and updates relevant documentation and examples.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes a brief summary and relevant links, supports claims with evidence, explains root causes and implementation trade-offs, and follows the contributing guide.\n</details>\n\n**BEFORE SUBMITTING, PLEASE READ <https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/contributing>**\n",
