              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "ActiveSky"
            },
            "body": "Hi @tlrmchlsmth @mgoin @zyongye @AndreasKaratzas @yewentao256 @WoosukKwon, I rechecked #52845 and current main `c5f8adc0` against **#53005**. Both proposals filter the same invalid configurations on CUDA WNA16 dispatch, and #53005 already reports RTX 5080 tuning validation.\n\nTo follow AGENTS.md's duplicate-work rule, I have not added a competing main-sync/code commit or claimed fresh tuning results here; the description now records the overlap and validation limits.\n\nThis PR has been open since **August 19**. Could you please review which proposal should advance, and whether the existing CUDA-versus-Triton regression coverage here should be consolidated into that implementation? Thank you.\n",
